  "answer": "## Summary\n\nI've completed the deep research and found **4 unique ASM journal articles** that include as an author either the 2nd, 3rd, or 4th author from the 25th reference of the target article.\n\n### Target Article\n- **Title**: \"Comparison of a Commercial Real-Time PCR Assay for tcdB Detection to a Cell Culture Cytotoxicity Assay and Toxigenic Culture for Direct Detection of Toxin-Producing Clostridium difficile in Clinical Samples\"\n- **Journal**: Journal of Clinical Microbiology (2009)\n- **25th Reference**: Shanholtzer et al. 1992 (J Clin Microbiol 30:1837-1840)\n\n### Authors from Reference 25 (positions 2, 3, 4)\n- **2nd**: K. E. Willard (Keith E. Willard)\n- **3rd**: J. J. Holter\n- **4th**: M. M. Olson (Mary M. Olson)\n\n### Articles Found (4 total)\n\n| # | Article | Journal | Year | Authors from Target Set |\n|---|---------|---------|------|------------------------|\n| 1 | Comparison of the VIDAS C. difficile toxin A immunoassay... | J Clin Microbiol | 1992 | **All three** (Willard, Holter, Olson) |\n| 2 | Comparison of traditional gas chromatography... | J Clin Microbiol | 1991 | **Willard** |\n| 3 | Detection of gyrA gene mutations... | Antimicrob Agents Chemother | 1992 | **Willard** |\n| 4 | Detection of asymptomatic C. difficile carriage... | J Clin Microbiol | 1989 | **Olson** |\n\n### Key Findings\n- Only **Journal of Clinical Microbiology** and **Antimicrobial Agents and Chemotherapy** (both ASM journals) contained articles by these authors\n- No articles found in other ASM journals (mBio, Infection and Immunity, J Bacteriology, J Virology, etc.)\n- The 1992 Shanholtzer et al. article is the **only article shared by all three target authors**\n\nFull report with citations, DOIs, and source URLs saved to: `/home/ubuntu/.hermes/research/deepsearchqa-0644/final_report.md`",
